From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:54:51 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 62/68] Meridian: a space switch doesn't wait for its slide
 animation

A hidden or covered window doesn't run animations; the switch now follows a
timer of the animation's length.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
---
 .../resources/webui_browser/meridian/sidebar.ts        | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/sidebar.ts b/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/sidebar.ts
index ef67bbb563..b56f373dab 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/sidebar.ts
+++ b/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/sidebar.ts
@@ -1204,11 +1204,11 @@ export class MeridianSidebarElement extends CrLitElement implements
     const shift = this.ghostDir_ * width;
     page?.animate([{transform: `translateX(${from}px)`},
                    {transform: `translateX(${to}px)`}], opts);
-    const done = ghost ?
-        ghost.animate([{transform: `translateX(${from + shift}px)`},
-                       {transform: `translateX(${to + shift}px)`}], opts)
-            .finished :
-        new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, duration));
+    ghost?.animate([{transform: `translateX(${from + shift}px)`},
+                    {transform: `translateX(${to + shift}px)`}], opts);
+    // A timer, not the animation's end: a hidden or covered window doesn't
+    // run animations, and the switch mustn't wait for them.
+    const done = new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, duration));
     const start = performance.now();
     const tint = () => {
       const k = Math.min(1, (performance.now() - start) / duration);
